# The phaser on Horst III at each setting (Plan 6 Task 11). Original ids only.
# The rubble (health 2, down at 2, damaged from setting 1) takes setting - 1 + 1 a shot: setting 1 leaves it
# at 1 and stunned, and a second shot at setting 2 takes it below 0, which clears it. The phaser won't fire
# at a crew member at all (firePhaser fails on crew), so no one on the team can be shot down.
seed 42
start 7 1 0
advance 65
# the low setting on the rubble: stunned, not cleared
phaser 1
use 000000 070103 007003
# the medium setting at a teammate: the phaser refuses, with its line
phaser 2
use 000000 000001 007003
# the medium setting on the rubble again: cleared
use 000000 070103 007003
# the high setting at the chasm, which can't be shot
phaser 3
use 000000 070108 007003
# the teammate is still on their feet, and looks at the passage the shots opened
look 000001 070102
end
